title: "discover: a pre-release discoverability check"
abstract: "A command-line check that a repository, package, static site and video plan carry what search engines, AI search and registries read: a benefit-first README, topics, package keywords, CITATION.cff, JSON-LD, sitemap, llms.txt and video chapters."
